ShortDescription: Parametric CAD you write as code, with an MCP server for the model that writes it
Description: ParCAD builds parts from a small JavaScript DSL and evaluates them with an exact B-rep kernel (OpenCASCADE). Every report is measured from the geometry, and the same host serves the app, an HTTP API and an MCP endpoint for agents.
